   247	- Reproduced: `vault/raw/escape.md -> /outside/secret.md` was counted by `backfill_vault(..., execute=False)`; case-sensitive `fnmatch` admitted `.CLAUDE/SKILL.md` and `raw/claude.md`. Edge filtering alone was insufficient because exact readers/node search could cross Graphiti groups. [Task 2]
